#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rst:2
msgid "rcumsum"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rcumsum:1
msgid ""
"Returns the reversely cumulative sum of elements of ``x`` in the "
"dimension ``dim``."
msgstr "次元 ``dim`` における ``x`` の要素の逆方向累積和を返します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rcumsum:4
msgid ""
"This is the reverse-direction counterpart of :func:`torch.cumsum`: the "
":math:`i`-th output element is the sum of all elements at or after "
"position :math:`i` along the dimension.  This is useful, for example, to "
"compute the total of future values at each time step."
msgstr ""
"これは :func:`torch.cumsum` の逆方向版です。:math:`i` 番目の出力要素は、次元に沿って位置 :math:`i` "
"以降にあるすべての要素の和です。これは、例えば各時点における将来の値の合計を計算するのに有用です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rcumsum:10
msgid "The input tensor."
msgstr "入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rcumsum:13
msgid "The dimension along which to compute the reversely cumulative sum."
msgstr "逆方向累積和を計算する次元。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rcumsum:17
msgid ""
"A tensor of the same shape as the input, where each element is the sum of"
" the input elements at or after its position along the dimension."
msgstr "入力と同じ形状のテンソルで、各要素は次元に沿ってその位置以降にある入力要素の和です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rcumsum:23
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rcumsum:25
msgid ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, 3.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> QF.rcumsum(x, dim=0)\n"
"tensor([10.,  9.,  7.,  4.])"
msgstr ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, 3.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> QF.rcumsum(x, dim=0)\n"
"tensor([10.,  9.,  7.,  4.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rcumsum:29
msgid ""
"NaN values propagate in the direction of accumulation: because the "
"accumulation runs from the end of the dimension, all positions at or "
"before a NaN become NaN."
msgstr "NaN 値は累積の方向に伝播します。累積は次元の末尾から実行されるため、NaN と同じ位置およびそれより前のすべての位置が NaN になります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rcumsum:34
msgid ":func:`rcummax`: Reversely cumulative maximum function."
msgstr ":func:`rcummax`: 逆方向の累積最大値関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rcumsum:35
msgid ":func:`nancumsum`: NaN-aware cumulative sum function."
msgstr ":func:`nancumsum`: NaN を考慮した累積和関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcumsum.rcumsum:36
msgid "``torch.cumsum``: Standard (forward) cumulative sum."
msgstr "``torch.cumsum``: 標準の（順方向の）累積和。"

